#: ../../../source/user_guide/subroutines.rst:4
msgid ""
"It is often the case for us to perform simulations with **USER-"
"Subroutines** in ABAQUS. ABQflow supports the usage of subroutines in a "
"batch. The subroutine file can be specified in :class:`~ABQflow.JobSpec` "
"using ``subroutine`` attribute by :class:`~ABQflow.SubroutineSpec` "
"object."
